title Cassette (deck, 640x480 at 11.3 px/mm): the record countdown at the deck density; every control at least the toolkit touch target (79 px)
sizes 640x480
ppmm 1130
env CASSETTE_DEMO countdown
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 600
shot deck-countdown
expect esc
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
